title: WakeUp
position: 468,16
---
It's been a couple of days since you last saw your cat. You are beginning to become a bit worried.
You feel like she might be over the bridge connected to the old abandoned house.
===
title: BridgeChecked
position: 427,191
---
You check the bridge, and notice the muddy paw prints which lead over the the other side.
However, the bridge is broken so you can't cross it.
(Press space to change into a ghost.)
===
title: GhostForm
position: 441,353
---
You transform into a ghost and are now able to cross the bridge. However, you need to leave your body behind.
(Press space when you are near your body to return to it.)
===
